  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#dom-open\n\nThe algorithm of window.open() method, step 5 states:\n\n> Let replace be the fourth argument.\n\nBut this argument is not used anywhere in the algorithm.\nIt should affect to some behavior, since the brief decription of the method says:\n\n> The replace attribute, if true, means that whatever page is currently open in that window will be removed from the window's session history.\n",
